  <wpt lat="52.417390029877424" lon="-117.39647598937154">
    <ele>0</ele>
    <time>2026-08-24T14:43:26Z</time>
    <name>*Jonas Creek Campground</name>
    <cmt>description: Open: June 5 to September 9, 2024&lt;br&gt;"Campsite #14 is designated for bike camping only."&lt;br&gt;https://parks.canada.ca/pn-np/ab/jasper/activ/passez-stay/camping#jonas&lt;br&gt;National Park Campground&lt;br&gt;"Reservable: All sites available on a First Come, First Served basis. No reservations possible."&lt;br&gt;"cooking shelter"&lt;br&gt;"A night at Jonas can be spent camping within earshot of the babbling creek. Hardy campers looking to get away from it all can also walk into hillside sites secluded in the forest. In addition, a bike camping area can be found near the cooking shelter, offering a great stop-over option for cyclists tackling the length of the Icefields Parkway.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Campsite #14 is designated for bike camping only. This is a shared site for unsupported bike touring and can accommodate 10 tents.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Best suited for tents as well as motorhomes and trailers under 25 feet"&lt;br&gt;Type: Approved Accommodation (campground)&lt;br&gt;ID:</cmt>
    <desc>description: Open: June 5 to September 9, 2024&lt;br&gt;"Campsite #14 is designated for bike camping only."&lt;br&gt;https://parks.canada.ca/pn-np/ab/jasper/activ/passez-stay/camping#jonas&lt;br&gt;National Park Campground&lt;br&gt;"Reservable: All sites available on a First Come, First Served basis. No reservations possible."&lt;br&gt;"cooking shelter"&lt;br&gt;"A night at Jonas can be spent camping within earshot of the babbling creek. Hardy campers looking to get away from it all can also walk into hillside sites secluded in the forest. In addition, a bike camping area can be found near the cooking shelter, offering a great stop-over option for cyclists tackling the length of the Icefields Parkway.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Campsite #14 is designated for bike camping only. This is a shared site for unsupported bike touring and can accommodate 10 tents.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Best suited for tents as well as motorhomes and trailers under 25 feet"&lt;br&gt;Type: Approved Accommodation (campground)&lt;br&gt;ID:</desc>
    <sym>Flag, Blue</sym>
    <type>user</type>
