  <wpt lat="46.224388014525175" lon="-64.330792017281055">
    <ele>0</ele>
    <time>2026-08-24T14:43:26Z</time>
    <name>Gagnon Beach</name>
    <cmt>description: CHECK OUT IS AT 11AM and CHECK IN IS AT 1PM.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Unserviced (Field Camping) – Located in our open field area, this section is perfect for tenters! Pitch your tent(any size), park your vehicle and still have room for a campfire and picnic lunch. The added bonus is that you are only a short walk from our beautiful sandy beach!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Depending on the location of the tent site, Wi-fi signal may be connected to your devices at an additional cost. Washrooms with outdoor sink access and showers are available for campers’ use.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; ADA Accessible&lt;br&gt; Back-In lots&lt;br&gt; Fire Pit provided&lt;br&gt; Pet-Friendly&lt;br&gt; Picnic Table provided&lt;br&gt; Coin operated laundry onsite&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;https://gagnonbeach.ca/rates-reservations/&lt;br&gt;Type: Privately Owned Campground&lt;br&gt;ID:</cmt>
    <desc>description: CHECK OUT IS AT 11AM and CHECK IN IS AT 1PM.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Unserviced (Field Camping) – Located in our open field area, this section is perfect for tenters! Pitch your tent(any size), park your vehicle and still have room for a campfire and picnic lunch. The added bonus is that you are only a short walk from our beautiful sandy beach!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Depending on the location of the tent site, Wi-fi signal may be connected to your devices at an additional cost. Washrooms with outdoor sink access and showers are available for campers’ use.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; ADA Accessible&lt;br&gt; Back-In lots&lt;br&gt; Fire Pit provided&lt;br&gt; Pet-Friendly&lt;br&gt; Picnic Table provided&lt;br&gt; Coin operated laundry onsite&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;https://gagnonbeach.ca/rates-reservations/&lt;br&gt;Type: Privately Owned Campground&lt;br&gt;ID:</desc>
