    <time>2026-08-24T14:43:26Z</time>
    <name>Goldpan Provincial Park</name>
    <cmt>description: "Alert icon&lt;br&gt;Goldpan Provincial Park Closed until further Notice&lt;br&gt;Due to slope instability and risk to public safety the campground at Goldpan Provincial Park will remain closed until further notice. Geo-technical information provided by Ministry of Transportation and Infrastructure on slope stability, and recent slide activity in the park have indicated a high level of risk for visitors staying within the campground. Therefore, BC Parks has made the decision to close the park. We will continue to explore options for future opening and visitors should consult this website for updates.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Updated September 27, 2023"&lt;br&gt;https://bcparks.ca/goldpan-park/#park-advisory-details-container&lt;br&gt;Details from Google Maps&lt;br&gt;#1, Spences Bridge, BC V0K 2L0&lt;br&gt;bcparks.ca&lt;br&gt;+1 250-320-9305&lt;br&gt;Type: Closed for renovations&lt;br&gt;ID:</cmt>
    <desc>description: "Alert icon&lt;br&gt;Goldpan Provincial Park Closed until further Notice&lt;br&gt;Due to slope instability and risk to public safety the campground at Goldpan Provincial Park will remain closed until further notice. Geo-technical information provided by Ministry of Transportation and Infrastructure on slope stability, and recent slide activity in the park have indicated a high level of risk for visitors staying within the campground. Therefore, BC Parks has made the decision to close the park. We will continue to explore options for future opening and visitors should consult this website for updates.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Updated September 27, 2023"&lt;br&gt;https://bcparks.ca/goldpan-park/#park-advisory-details-container&lt;br&gt;Details from Google Maps&lt;br&gt;#1, Spences Bridge, BC V0K 2L0&lt;br&gt;bcparks.ca&lt;br&gt;+1 250-320-9305&lt;br&gt;Type: Closed for renovations&lt;br&gt;ID:</desc>
