  <wpt lat="52.555810958147049" lon="-117.68139800056815">
    <ele>0</ele>
    <time>2026-08-24T14:43:26Z</time>
    <name>Honeymoon Lake Campground (Jasper National Park)</name>
    <cmt>description: "&lt;br&gt;Honeymoon Lake&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; Open: May 15 to September 9, 2024&lt;br&gt; Reservable: All sites available on a First Come, First Served basis. No reservations possible.&lt;br&gt; Sites: 34&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; Fees: See full list of camping fees here&lt;br&gt; Site type:&lt;br&gt; Unserviced, with fire pit&lt;br&gt; Bike camping (campsite #24 only)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Being able to replace ringing phones, noisy traffic and city smog with quiet lakeside strolls and the smell of breakfast cooking over a campfire gives you a sense of how Honeymoon Lake Campground got its name.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Campsite #24 is designated for bike camping only. This is a shared site for unsupported bike touring and can accommodate 6 tents.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Best suited for tents as well as motorhomes and trailers under 27 feet"&lt;br&gt;https://parks.canada.ca/pn-np/ab/jasper/activ/passez-stay/camping#honeymoon&lt;br&gt;National Park Campground&lt;br&gt;Type: Approved Accommodation (campground)&lt;br&gt;ID:</cmt>
    <desc>description: "&lt;br&gt;Honeymoon Lake&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; Open: May 15 to September 9, 2024&lt;br&gt; Reservable: All sites available on a First Come, First Served basis. No reservations possible.&lt;br&gt; Sites: 34&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; Fees: See full list of camping fees here&lt;br&gt; Site type:&lt;br&gt; Unserviced, with fire pit&lt;br&gt; Bike camping (campsite #24 only)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Being able to replace ringing phones, noisy traffic and city smog with quiet lakeside strolls and the smell of breakfast cooking over a campfire gives you a sense of how Honeymoon Lake Campground got its name.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Campsite #24 is designated for bike camping only. This is a shared site for unsupported bike touring and can accommodate 6 tents.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Best suited for tents as well as motorhomes and trailers under 27 feet"&lt;br&gt;https://parks.canada.ca/pn-np/ab/jasper/activ/passez-stay/camping#honeymoon&lt;br&gt;National Park Campground&lt;br&gt;Type: Approved Accommodation (campground)&lt;br&gt;ID:</desc>
    <sym>Campground</sym>
