    <ele>0</ele>
    <time>2026-06-27T16:35:11Z</time>
    <name>Summit River Lodge &amp; Campsites</name>
    <cmt>description: All Sites have green grass, picnic table and fire pit. Free wifi and use of campers washroom with free hot showers. We have water fill up station plus a sani-dump. We are adding all sites individually but for the moment we have added just general campsite so you can book online. Most site available have full service but it’s first come first serve this summer with site preference given to multi night bookings .&lt;br&gt;https://www.summitriverlodge.com/en/1219124/overview&lt;br&gt;Details from Google Maps&lt;br&gt;19345 BC-5, Valemount, BC V0E 2Z0&lt;br&gt;www.summitriverlodge.com&lt;br&gt;+1 250-566-9933&lt;br&gt;Type: Privately Owned Campground&lt;br&gt;ID: 283.0</cmt>
