    <cmt>description: "Tenting near the river or between the trees.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;White River Resort has a large tenting area that is set in a meadow, surrounded by trees, and bordered on one side by the White River.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Campers in this area have their own power sources 15 and 30 amp, and a water tap at each site. Washrooms with flush toilets and shower facilities are also provided. Showers are coin operated, they accept loonies only."&lt;br&gt;https://saywardwhiteriverresort.com/&lt;br&gt;Type: Privately Owned Campground&lt;br&gt;ID:</cmt>
